WEBVTT

01:20.900 --> 01:26.680
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.460 --> 01:29.760
[Episode 20]

01:30.039 --> 01:31.190
Mrs. He.

01:31.480 --> 01:32.479
Everyone is waiting for you.

01:32.479 --> 01:33.150
Hurry up.

01:33.350 --> 01:34.120
-Hurry.
-I…

01:36.350 --> 01:38.160
Then I shall make a fool of myself.

01:36.430 --> 01:37.870
[Xiang Minghui, He Wenxin's wife]

01:38.400 --> 01:39.310
Hurry up and go.

01:39.430 --> 01:40.400
Just for you,

01:40.400 --> 01:42.600
I'll add another 100 taels to the prize.

01:51.000 --> 01:52.150
Which lord

01:52.560 --> 01:55.820
would do us the honor
of stepping into the arena for a match?

02:22.150 --> 02:23.280
Then I...

02:23.840 --> 02:25.790
will reluctantly give it a try.

02:46.400 --> 02:48.380
Lord Chen hit 5 out of 5,

02:48.470 --> 02:50.450
and Mrs. He hit 2 out of 5.

02:51.280 --> 02:52.630
Lord Chen wins!

02:53.480 --> 02:54.920
Total prize money,

02:54.950 --> 02:56.240
1,000 taels!

03:08.760 --> 03:10.330
Brother Wenxiu is up!

03:17.400 --> 03:18.150
Yanying.

03:19.120 --> 03:20.710
Where did your third brother

03:20.710 --> 03:21.710
learn archery?

03:22.430 --> 03:23.150
He learned it from the guards

03:23.150 --> 03:24.670
when he was young.

03:24.800 --> 03:26.150
But he must have mastered it after working

03:26.150 --> 03:27.610
at the government office.

03:40.180 --> 03:42.390
Lord Chen hit all 5 shots.

03:43.360 --> 03:46.070
Young Master Yao hit 3.

03:46.370 --> 03:47.710
Total prize money,

03:48.120 --> 03:50.220
1,500 taels!

03:50.750 --> 03:52.240
He won another round?

03:54.120 --> 03:55.520
Yanying, it's your turn.

04:28.720 --> 04:30.630
Lord Chen wins again!

04:31.270 --> 04:32.430
Total prize money,

04:32.680 --> 04:34.120
2,000 taels!

04:36.430 --> 04:36.870
Hya!

04:42.720 --> 04:44.190
Didn't you say you could win?

04:44.190 --> 04:45.750
He usually let me win.

04:46.040 --> 04:47.430
Why didn't he today?

04:49.240 --> 04:50.390
Watch me defeat him.

05:09.550 --> 05:10.150
Miss Xue,

05:10.480 --> 05:10.950
please.

05:11.120 --> 05:11.580
Please.

05:13.680 --> 05:14.040
Hya!

05:25.920 --> 05:26.400
Hya!

05:32.830 --> 05:33.600
He missed?

05:33.990 --> 05:35.290
How is that possible?

05:49.159 --> 05:50.940
What is my third brother doing?

05:54.750 --> 05:56.550
How could Jiuheng drop the ball?

06:06.120 --> 06:08.410
Lord Chen hit the bullseye twice

06:08.680 --> 06:10.000
and missed 3 times.

06:10.950 --> 06:13.880
Miss Xue hit the target all 5 times.

06:14.160 --> 06:14.950
Round one,

06:15.120 --> 06:16.870
-Hya!
-Miss Xue wins.

06:17.680 --> 06:19.140
What is wrong with Yanyun?

06:19.680 --> 06:21.430
He's clearly throwing the match

06:21.430 --> 06:22.630
to let Miss Xue win.

06:22.750 --> 06:24.240
But I clearly told him

06:24.360 --> 06:26.480
that Qinglan hates it
when people let her win.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.040
What?

06:27.680 --> 06:28.630
You told him that?

06:28.630 --> 06:29.520
Yes.

06:31.430 --> 06:33.159
Could he be doing it on purpose?

06:34.270 --> 06:36.530
Qinglan is definitely going to be angry.

07:00.870 --> 07:02.870
Why did you stop shooting, Miss Xue?

07:04.390 --> 07:05.790
How could you miss again?

07:06.510 --> 07:07.970
I am out of practice.

07:08.040 --> 07:09.920
After shooting so many times in a row,

07:09.920 --> 07:11.050
I got a little tired.

07:18.270 --> 07:19.160
I am done competing.

07:19.160 --> 07:19.870
I yield.

07:30.950 --> 07:32.390
Why bother, Miss Xue?

07:33.240 --> 07:35.100
You are obviously letting me win.

07:35.240 --> 07:36.159
By doing that,

07:36.159 --> 07:37.610
you're looking down on me.

07:37.610 --> 07:38.360
Since you look down on me,

07:38.360 --> 07:40.090
what's the point of competing?

07:40.560 --> 07:41.480
I'm not competing anymore.

07:41.480 --> 07:41.950
Hya!

07:45.870 --> 07:48.290
Qinglan has quite a short temper.

07:48.480 --> 07:50.100
I'm afraid Jiuheng

07:48.640 --> 07:50.550
[Dong Peiqin, Wang Xuanfan's wife]

07:50.270 --> 07:51.730
will suffer in the future.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.270
This child.

07:53.830 --> 07:54.750
Jiuheng was letting her win.

07:54.220 --> 07:56.690
[Dai Yuzhu, Fu Hailian's wife]

07:54.750 --> 07:55.950
Why did she get angry?

07:57.560 --> 07:58.190
Master,

07:58.430 --> 07:59.690
please don't be angry.

07:59.800 --> 08:01.060
I'll talk to her later.

08:04.510 --> 08:05.240
No need.

08:06.720 --> 08:08.380
Since they are not meant to be,

08:09.270 --> 08:10.360
don't force it.

08:24.000 --> 08:25.360
Your third brother
deliberately let me win.

08:25.360 --> 08:26.070
So boring.

08:26.430 --> 08:27.690
Qinglan, don't be mad.

08:27.720 --> 08:29.190
My third brother
has always been a gentleman.

08:29.190 --> 08:29.630
It's inevitable that...

08:29.630 --> 08:30.690
He is your brother.

08:33.669 --> 08:34.270
Forget it.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.960
I don't want to talk about it.

08:37.630 --> 08:38.320
Just seeing

08:38.320 --> 08:39.510
his arrogant look

08:39.909 --> 08:40.840
makes me angry.

08:47.600 --> 08:48.240
Let me try.

08:50.030 --> 08:50.600
Really?

08:52.000 --> 08:53.210
Great.

08:53.320 --> 08:54.720
If you can win,

08:55.000 --> 08:57.200
I'll add another 500 taels to the prize.

08:57.360 --> 08:59.320
Then you'd better get the money ready.

08:59.320 --> 08:59.750
Okay.

09:08.470 --> 09:09.680
This Miss Gu

09:09.700 --> 09:10.890
is quite something.

09:18.120 --> 09:19.120
I didn't expect Miss Xue

09:19.120 --> 09:20.120
to be so special

09:20.320 --> 09:21.120
to you.

09:21.550 --> 09:22.680
I have never seen you

09:22.720 --> 09:24.320
give in to someone like this.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.880
I was worried you wouldn't play.

09:28.160 --> 09:29.000
Why?

09:29.240 --> 09:30.770
You want to give in to me too?

09:32.030 --> 09:33.150
You are one of us.

09:34.030 --> 09:35.490
There's no need to give in.

09:46.630 --> 09:47.270
Yanying?

09:47.750 --> 09:48.510
Come and sit here,

09:48.510 --> 09:49.390
so you can see clearly.

09:49.390 --> 09:50.240
-Okay.
-Come.

09:53.390 --> 09:53.790
Hya!

10:13.030 --> 10:15.620
Lord Chen hit all 5 shots.

10:16.030 --> 10:18.580
Miss Gu hit all 5 shots.

10:19.080 --> 10:20.140
The first round...

10:20.550 --> 10:21.150
is a tie!

10:22.840 --> 10:23.890
Impressive!

10:24.340 --> 10:25.580
[Wang Zan, son of Wang Shenzhi,
Minister of the Court of Judicial Review]

10:24.800 --> 10:26.060
What is her name again?

10:26.390 --> 10:27.190
Young Master,

10:27.240 --> 10:28.570
his name is Chen Yanyun.

10:31.360 --> 10:33.150
How could I not know Third Mr. Chen?

10:33.150 --> 10:34.630
I was asking about the girl.

10:34.630 --> 10:36.090
Go find out her name for me.

10:36.390 --> 10:37.390
If you find out,

10:38.320 --> 10:39.520
you will be rewarded.

10:39.910 --> 10:40.600
Right away.

10:45.910 --> 10:47.040
Excellent archery.

10:48.510 --> 10:49.270
It's okay.

10:50.000 --> 10:51.360
My mentor wants to set me up

10:51.360 --> 10:52.720
with Miss Xue.

10:53.480 --> 10:54.600
I couldn't refuse.

10:55.270 --> 10:56.510
So I found some

10:56.510 --> 10:57.370
indirect ways.

10:57.790 --> 10:58.720
But don't worry.

10:59.440 --> 11:00.840
Nothing will ever happen

11:00.870 --> 11:01.550
between us.

11:05.080 --> 11:07.810
You're deliberately trying
to mess with my mind.

11:10.320 --> 11:10.750
Hya!

11:11.870 --> 11:12.840
Be careful.

11:20.080 --> 11:21.120
Round two.

11:22.710 --> 11:25.480
♪ The sharpness
that blooms as I cross the waves alone ♪

11:26.250 --> 11:27.270
♪ The direction
is held entirely in my own hands ♪

11:28.090 --> 11:29.110
♪ Yet I let
this boundless stretch of sea ♪

11:29.850 --> 11:32.650
♪ Create the dawn of reaching the shore ♪

11:33.380 --> 11:35.040
♪ All things grow as they pass through
the wind and waves ♪

11:35.630 --> 11:37.180
♪ Even in moments
of deep uncertainty ♪

11:37.840 --> 11:39.500
♪ Soothing the wounds
left by the turbulence ♪

11:40.270 --> 11:44.000
♪ The silhouette of sails pierces
the mist held high ♪

11:44.810 --> 11:48.160
♪ There is strength to voyage far ♪

11:47.120 --> 11:49.820
Lord Chen hit 5 out of 5.

11:50.120 --> 11:53.030
Miss Gu hit 5 out of 5.

11:51.490 --> 11:53.170
♪ In every chant sung
upon leaving the harbor ♪

11:53.480 --> 11:54.550
Round two...

11:53.910 --> 11:54.880
♪ Only through awakening
does the light appear ♪

11:55.440 --> 11:56.080
is a tie.

11:55.710 --> 11:58.240
♪ I alone am my own direction ♪

11:56.320 --> 11:57.720
Two ties in a row?

11:58.080 --> 11:59.750
It's rare to see a third round.

12:01.390 --> 12:02.030
Ruixiang.

12:03.630 --> 12:05.560
Add another 100 taels to the prize.

12:05.670 --> 12:06.440
Shout it out

12:06.440 --> 12:07.970
so others will add to it too.

12:08.080 --> 12:08.670
Yes.

12:09.050 --> 12:10.780
I'll add another 100 taels too.

12:13.870 --> 12:17.300
Eldest Miss Xue
added 100 taels to the prize.

12:17.400 --> 12:20.770
Sixth Miss Chen
added 100 taels to the prize.

12:21.320 --> 12:23.240
Madam Fu added 200 taels

12:24.030 --> 12:25.470
to the prize.

12:25.670 --> 12:27.480
Madam Wang added 200 taels

12:28.080 --> 12:29.630
to the prize.

12:30.000 --> 12:32.040
Madam He added 100 taels...

12:32.070 --> 12:33.000
How did you make that horse

12:33.000 --> 12:34.660
-recognize me?
-To the prize.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.790
You always use sweet osmanthus incense.

12:36.790 --> 12:38.550
After returning from Tongzhou,

12:38.550 --> 12:39.200
I had

12:39.200 --> 12:40.960
the groom for the Yuhuacong horse

12:40.960 --> 12:42.550
scent his clothes
with sweet osmanthus incense

12:42.550 --> 12:43.360
every day.

12:44.150 --> 12:45.280
This horse is smart.

12:45.480 --> 12:46.680
It didn't let me down.

12:49.200 --> 12:51.460
You really put a lot of thought into this.

12:54.750 --> 12:55.910
Did you

12:57.000 --> 12:58.600
think it over later?

13:02.720 --> 13:04.050
I have thought about it.

13:04.610 --> 13:05.740
If others marry you,

13:06.240 --> 13:08.120
they can become the wife
of a Grand Secretary

13:08.120 --> 13:09.580
and gain wealth and glory.

13:10.240 --> 13:11.300
But I am different.

13:11.390 --> 13:12.450
I don't lack money,

13:12.810 --> 13:13.720
and I don't want

13:13.720 --> 13:16.080
to gain wealth through marriage.

13:17.030 --> 13:18.550
After becoming a titled lady,

13:18.550 --> 13:19.610
every move of mine

13:19.910 --> 13:21.310
will be judged by others.

13:21.550 --> 13:22.510
And I must strictly follow the rules

13:22.510 --> 13:24.310
of feminine conduct and virtue.

13:25.480 --> 13:26.790
So I thought for a long time,

13:26.790 --> 13:28.240
and I still couldn't figure out

13:28.240 --> 13:29.040
what benefits

13:29.120 --> 13:30.720
marrying you would bring me.

13:31.910 --> 13:33.110
It's the same for you.

13:33.240 --> 13:34.050
Marrying me

13:34.270 --> 13:35.870
won't do you any good either.

13:36.030 --> 13:37.430
You are wrong about that.

13:37.720 --> 13:38.360
Perhaps

13:38.910 --> 13:40.770
marrying me won't do you any good,

13:41.270 --> 13:42.200
but marrying you

13:42.840 --> 13:44.390
would benefit me a lot.

13:46.360 --> 13:47.030
How so?

13:47.550 --> 13:48.240
Look.

13:49.150 --> 13:50.320
Everyone in court knows

13:50.320 --> 13:51.780
I am my mentor's disciple.

13:51.960 --> 13:52.630
If I marry

13:52.630 --> 13:54.030
the woman he chose for me,

13:54.750 --> 13:55.390
wouldn't that make me

13:55.390 --> 13:57.650
a full-fledged member of the Fu faction,

13:57.910 --> 13:59.080
tied down for life?

14:00.630 --> 14:01.600
But actually,

14:02.670 --> 14:04.330
I don't want to take sides yet.

14:06.840 --> 14:07.970
Don't say that here.

14:09.870 --> 14:11.670
Don't worry. They can't hear us.

14:12.200 --> 14:13.870
The situation in the court is changing,

14:13.870 --> 14:15.530
and everyone is changing too.

14:15.870 --> 14:16.750
Instead of

14:17.150 --> 14:19.120
tying my marriage to my stance

14:19.720 --> 14:21.270
for the next few decades

14:21.270 --> 14:21.960
now,

14:22.630 --> 14:23.360
I'd rather

14:24.200 --> 14:26.670
marry a woman
who doesn't represent any side

14:27.360 --> 14:27.840
and whom

14:27.840 --> 14:29.630
I can completely trust.

14:30.200 --> 14:31.400
And it just so happens

14:31.750 --> 14:33.550
that she's very rich.

14:35.630 --> 14:36.630
It just so happens

14:39.840 --> 14:41.600
that I really like this woman.

14:44.790 --> 14:46.870
I'm just very lucky.

14:48.480 --> 14:50.810
You really have a lot of nerve
saying that.

14:54.320 --> 14:55.650
There's one more thing.

14:56.240 --> 14:57.440
It just so happens...

15:05.360 --> 15:06.420
that this woman...

15:08.390 --> 15:09.510
also likes me.

15:14.720 --> 15:16.870
The third round of the competition
is about to begin.

15:16.870 --> 15:19.240
Lord Chen, Miss Gu,

15:19.240 --> 15:20.640
please come to the arena.

15:28.720 --> 15:29.520
Young Master,

15:29.670 --> 15:30.330
I found out.

15:30.440 --> 15:31.600
Her name is Gu Jinzhao.

15:31.600 --> 15:33.320
She is Lord Gu Deyuan's niece.

15:34.200 --> 15:35.510
Jinzhao?

15:37.440 --> 15:38.240
Good.

15:39.080 --> 15:40.120
If she wins,

15:40.320 --> 15:41.670
I will go compete with her.

15:41.670 --> 15:42.470
Young Master.

15:42.910 --> 15:44.030
What if this Miss Gu...

15:44.030 --> 15:44.960
loses?

15:45.320 --> 15:46.120
Loses?

15:46.960 --> 15:48.760
Then I'll defeat Third Mr. Chen!

15:49.870 --> 15:50.750
And avenge her.

15:50.750 --> 15:52.550
You are very wise, Young Master.

15:54.200 --> 15:54.720
Take it.

15:55.720 --> 15:57.200
Thank you, Young Master.

15:59.440 --> 16:00.810
Round three!

15:59.800 --> 16:02.570
♪ The sharpness
that blooms as I cross the waves alone ♪

16:00.870 --> 16:01.320
Hya!

16:01.600 --> 16:02.030
Hya!

16:03.340 --> 16:04.430
♪ The direction
is held entirely in my own hands ♪

16:05.180 --> 16:06.340
♪ Yet I let
this boundless stretch of sea ♪

16:06.940 --> 16:09.780
♪ Create the dawn of reaching the shore ♪

16:10.470 --> 16:12.130
♪ All things grow as they pass through
the wind and waves ♪

16:12.730 --> 16:14.110
♪ Even in moments
of deep uncertainty ♪

16:14.930 --> 16:16.590
♪ Soothing the wounds
left by the turbulence ♪

16:17.360 --> 16:21.090
♪ The silhouette of sails pierces
the mist held high ♪

16:21.900 --> 16:25.250
♪ There is strength to voyage far ♪

16:27.360 --> 16:28.480
Round three,

16:28.580 --> 16:30.260
♪ In every chant sung
upon leaving the harbor ♪

16:28.790 --> 16:30.200
Miss Gu wins!

16:30.750 --> 16:31.480
For this match,

16:31.000 --> 16:31.970
♪ Only through awakening
does the light appear ♪

16:32.080 --> 16:33.730
Miss Gu wins!

16:32.800 --> 16:33.540
♪ I alone am my own direction ♪

16:34.150 --> 16:35.510
Total prize money,

16:34.290 --> 16:36.000
♪ When the boat itself
becomes a lighthouse ♪

16:36.270 --> 16:37.720
-4,500 taels!
-Excellent!

16:37.040 --> 16:38.530
♪ When the voyage transcends the arrival ♪

16:37.720 --> 16:38.780
Bring us some wine!

16:39.570 --> 16:43.810
♪ Looking back the world stretches
to the ends of the earth ♪

16:57.670 --> 16:58.200
Bravo.

17:00.460 --> 17:01.170
Strike.

17:01.600 --> 17:01.960
Yes.

17:02.480 --> 17:03.010
Let's go!

17:08.880 --> 17:09.400
Hya!

17:09.640 --> 17:12.270
-Hya!
-Hya!

17:12.480 --> 17:15.000
-Hya!
-Hya!

17:16.069 --> 17:17.349
-Hya!
-Hya!

17:19.000 --> 17:20.069
The Penal Court is handling a case!

17:20.069 --> 17:21.640
-Unauthorized persons, step aside!
-Gu Jinzhao.

17:21.640 --> 17:22.640
I'm coming!

17:25.550 --> 17:27.440
-Hya!
-Hya!

17:28.160 --> 17:28.550
Hya!

17:29.270 --> 17:32.200
-Hya!
-Hya!

17:33.790 --> 17:34.850
[Outing]

17:34.310 --> 17:36.960
-Hya!
-Hya!

17:37.920 --> 17:38.350
Hya!

17:39.920 --> 17:41.400
-Hya!
-Hya!

17:50.350 --> 17:51.750
The Penal Court
is arresting a major criminal.

17:51.750 --> 17:52.410
Step aside!

17:52.550 --> 17:54.480
The constables of the Penal Court?

17:54.830 --> 17:56.000
Why are they here?

18:22.950 --> 18:23.680
Arrest them!

18:34.680 --> 18:35.160
Honey.

18:36.790 --> 18:37.160
Let's go!

18:37.160 --> 18:37.590
Madam!

18:37.750 --> 18:38.350
How impudent!

18:38.350 --> 18:38.680
Move!

18:38.790 --> 18:39.310
How impudent!

18:39.310 --> 18:40.790
I am an Imperial Court official!

18:40.790 --> 18:42.310
Director of the Ministry of Justice!

18:42.310 --> 18:43.350
How dare the Penal Court

18:43.350 --> 18:45.150
act with such insubordination!

18:45.350 --> 18:47.200
I demand to see His Majesty!

18:47.960 --> 18:48.400
Move!

18:56.640 --> 18:57.040
Kneel!

18:58.790 --> 19:00.130
Who did they arrest?

19:00.470 --> 19:01.160
Xuanweng,

19:01.720 --> 19:04.440
it's Du Wangfa,
Director of the Ministry of Justice.

19:04.440 --> 19:05.470
Who's leading the action?

19:05.470 --> 19:06.400
Is it Zhang Ling?

19:06.590 --> 19:08.050
It's not Commander Zhang.

19:08.200 --> 19:08.720
It's...

19:09.500 --> 19:10.430
Young Master Ye.

20:18.830 --> 20:19.290
My Lord,

20:19.480 --> 20:20.480
we arrested them.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.020
Take them back.

20:23.070 --> 20:23.440
Yes.

20:24.160 --> 20:24.640
Take them away!

20:24.640 --> 20:25.000
Move!

20:25.680 --> 20:26.400
Let go of me!

20:27.920 --> 20:29.720
I am an Imperial Court official!

20:30.240 --> 20:30.800
Let go!

20:32.480 --> 20:33.030
Hold on!

20:39.160 --> 20:40.110
On today's Spring Outing,

20:40.110 --> 20:41.350
all the guests
are important court officials

20:41.350 --> 20:42.160
and their families.

20:42.160 --> 20:43.960
How dare you cause trouble here?

20:45.270 --> 20:45.930
Who are you?

20:47.070 --> 20:47.830
Xue Qinglan,

20:48.200 --> 20:49.460
one of the hosts today.

20:52.480 --> 20:54.810
Then you are harboring a wanted criminal.

20:56.070 --> 20:57.920
Do you want to end up
in the Penal Court's prison too?

20:57.920 --> 20:58.650
How dare you!

20:59.400 --> 21:00.530
Why wouldn't I dare?

21:01.110 --> 21:02.370
If you can't accept it,

21:02.510 --> 21:04.480
tell your old man
to complain at the Golden Celestial Hall.

21:04.480 --> 21:05.080
Stop!

21:12.680 --> 21:14.210
Don't rely on your numbers.

21:14.310 --> 21:15.480
If you have the guts,

21:15.480 --> 21:16.640
fight me in a real battle.

21:16.640 --> 21:17.160
Fight?

21:21.830 --> 21:23.490
The Penal Court never fights.

21:24.440 --> 21:25.770
We either arrest people

21:26.810 --> 21:27.690
or kill them.

21:36.440 --> 21:36.970
Let's go!

21:42.710 --> 21:43.840
Don't act rashly!

21:44.790 --> 21:46.420
None of the ministers made a move.

21:46.420 --> 21:48.080
Why are you acting on impulse?

21:48.720 --> 21:50.280
They have gone too far.

21:51.600 --> 21:52.400
I heard that Ye Xian

21:52.400 --> 21:53.520
is a madman.

21:53.790 --> 21:54.790
He might actually

21:54.790 --> 21:56.640
arrest you
and put you in the imperial prison.

21:56.640 --> 21:58.840
You'll be the one who suffers in the end.

22:02.310 --> 22:03.000
A madman?

22:06.310 --> 22:08.170
Then we'll have to see about that.

22:14.590 --> 22:15.110
What?

22:15.840 --> 22:19.410
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

22:16.240 --> 22:16.960
Zhao

22:17.480 --> 22:19.160
actually defeated Lord Chen?

22:20.160 --> 22:21.730
Lord Chen let her win.

22:22.640 --> 22:23.630
You have no idea.

22:23.790 --> 22:25.450
He had won 3 times in a row.

22:25.550 --> 22:27.280
He must have felt embarrassed.

22:27.350 --> 22:28.200
Starting with Xue Qinglan,

22:28.200 --> 22:29.400
he began to hold back.

22:29.440 --> 22:30.720
Who would have expected that Xue Qinglan

22:30.720 --> 22:31.920
would be so ungrateful?

22:31.920 --> 22:33.680
She actually threw her arrows
on the ground

22:33.680 --> 22:34.550
and refused to let him hold back.

22:34.550 --> 22:36.270
And that's how it became Zhao's turn.

22:36.270 --> 22:37.200
In that case,

22:38.000 --> 22:39.920
Zhao shouldn't have won.

22:40.160 --> 22:41.510
Even Xue Qinglan,

22:42.400 --> 22:43.400
given her status,

22:43.590 --> 22:44.790
was willing to yield.

22:45.790 --> 22:47.190
The girls from our family

22:47.920 --> 22:49.590
should be more modest.

22:51.840 --> 22:55.640
[Crystal-Clear at Heart]

22:52.790 --> 22:53.590
I heard yesterday

22:53.590 --> 22:54.650
that Xian also came

22:54.790 --> 22:55.960
and arrested someone.

22:55.960 --> 22:56.510
Yes, yes.

22:56.720 --> 22:57.920
Xian suddenly

22:57.920 --> 22:59.270
brought the constables of the Penal Court

22:59.270 --> 23:00.110
and rushed in.

23:00.480 --> 23:01.030
He insisted on

23:01.030 --> 23:02.440
arresting Director Du
of the Ministry of Justice and his family

23:02.440 --> 23:03.400
on the spot.

23:03.920 --> 23:05.300
Wenxiu said

23:05.550 --> 23:07.610
he had never seen an arrest like that.

23:08.000 --> 23:09.070
I don't know

23:09.070 --> 23:10.350
what happened to Xian.

23:10.830 --> 23:12.880
He's a completely different person now.

23:12.880 --> 23:14.550
Quite scary.

23:15.110 --> 23:16.570
What's so scary about him?

23:31.710 --> 23:32.470
I heard

23:32.510 --> 23:32.880
everyone

23:32.880 --> 23:34.480
was talking here at Old Madam's place.

23:34.480 --> 23:35.810
I'm here to join the fun.

23:36.790 --> 23:37.590
Lian,

23:38.030 --> 23:39.230
what were you saying?

23:39.240 --> 23:40.200
What did Xian do

23:40.200 --> 23:41.400
to make you so scared?

23:44.270 --> 23:45.240
Nothing.

23:45.590 --> 23:47.440
It's just that Xian

23:47.440 --> 23:49.440
brought the constables of the Penal Court

23:49.440 --> 23:50.680
to the Spring Outing

23:50.720 --> 23:53.650
and arrested Director Du
of the Ministry of Justice.

23:54.070 --> 23:56.070
I thought it was something serious.

23:56.110 --> 23:57.510
The Penal Court arrests people

23:57.510 --> 23:58.960
under His Majesty's orders.

23:58.960 --> 24:00.310
If His Majesty
tells him to make an arrest,

24:00.310 --> 24:01.640
let alone the Spring Outing,

24:01.640 --> 24:02.590
even at the Luming Banquet,

24:02.590 --> 24:03.750
he still has to do it.

24:04.000 --> 24:05.860
What's there to make a fuss about?

24:07.920 --> 24:08.720
Yes.

24:10.030 --> 24:11.560
I heard from people outside

24:11.590 --> 24:13.160
that the Grand Secretary

24:13.350 --> 24:14.400
intended to play matchmaker for Lord Chen

24:14.400 --> 24:15.590
and Xue Qinglan.

24:15.640 --> 24:17.770
That's why he held this Spring Outing.

24:17.960 --> 24:19.790
That's what they say.

24:20.750 --> 24:22.680
That would be a powerful alliance.

24:23.070 --> 24:23.930
The Chen family

24:24.110 --> 24:26.240
may be a noble family for generations,

24:26.440 --> 24:27.440
but the Xue family

24:27.570 --> 24:28.800
has also been a top civil-official family

24:28.800 --> 24:30.720
since the founding of the state,

24:31.310 --> 24:33.720
and they're in-laws
with the Grand Secretary.

24:33.720 --> 24:34.590
Looks like

24:35.200 --> 24:35.750
Lord Chen

24:36.070 --> 24:37.490
is just a few steps away

24:37.590 --> 24:39.320
from soaring to great heights.

24:41.960 --> 24:42.680
Zhao.

24:44.030 --> 24:45.590
I heard your maternal grandmother

24:45.590 --> 24:47.200
has been following the Chen family

24:47.200 --> 24:48.510
for over ten years.

24:51.160 --> 24:52.160
Businessmen

24:52.590 --> 24:54.750
are best at speculation,

24:55.790 --> 24:57.720
and she clearly has good judgment.

25:00.240 --> 25:01.270
My grandmother

25:01.510 --> 25:02.550
didn't just bet on

25:02.550 --> 25:04.010
the Chen family back then—

25:04.160 --> 25:05.590
she also placed high hopes

25:05.590 --> 25:06.830
on our Gu family,

25:08.000 --> 25:09.240
which is why she married my mother off

25:09.240 --> 25:10.240
to my father.

25:11.720 --> 25:12.580
And the result?

25:14.750 --> 25:15.950
It seems her judgment

25:15.960 --> 25:17.220
is sometimes accurate

25:17.510 --> 25:18.570
and sometimes not.

25:20.550 --> 25:22.110
If you ask me,

25:22.270 --> 25:23.310
I don't think

25:23.480 --> 25:24.400
Xue Qinglan is really

25:24.400 --> 25:25.960
a good match for Chen Yanyun.

25:25.960 --> 25:27.550
She was previously engaged,

25:27.550 --> 25:29.080
and her fiancé passed away.

25:29.270 --> 25:31.600
Chen Yanyun has also been married before.

25:32.400 --> 25:33.110
Really?

25:33.510 --> 25:35.550
How can it be the same?

25:36.070 --> 25:37.800
If a man has been married,

25:37.830 --> 25:39.110
he can marry again.

25:39.640 --> 25:41.500
But if a woman has been betrothed,

25:41.880 --> 25:44.160
she is considered flawed.

25:45.550 --> 25:46.350
That's true.

25:47.160 --> 25:49.030
Not to mention
that her fiancé passed away—

25:49.030 --> 25:50.480
even divorce

25:51.400 --> 25:52.680
is looked down upon

25:52.960 --> 25:54.160
and despised.

25:54.720 --> 25:56.160
So what?

25:56.510 --> 25:58.440
You can't judge a book by its cover.

25:58.510 --> 26:00.070
Living a good life for yourself

26:00.070 --> 26:01.350
is better than suffering in silence

26:01.350 --> 26:02.590
to save face

26:02.720 --> 26:04.120
and keep up appearances.

26:15.920 --> 26:16.680
Zhao.

26:18.790 --> 26:19.550
Fifth Aunt.

26:23.550 --> 26:25.240
You were like a firecracker today,

26:25.240 --> 26:27.480
getting all fired up as you were talking.

26:27.480 --> 26:28.880
They came at me first.

26:29.830 --> 26:31.510
It's one thing to talk about me,

26:31.510 --> 26:34.110
but bringing up
my maternal family crosses the line.

26:34.110 --> 26:35.640
I had to hit back

26:35.960 --> 26:37.360
so it won't happen again.

26:37.960 --> 26:39.820
Weren't you the same, Fifth Aunt?

26:40.230 --> 26:41.230
It was different.

26:41.750 --> 26:43.200
When they spoke ill of Xian,

26:43.200 --> 26:44.310
no matter how angry I was,

26:44.310 --> 26:44.880
I could only

26:44.880 --> 26:45.940
take it out on Lian.

26:47.070 --> 26:47.920
Fifth Aunt,

26:48.030 --> 26:49.440
you were just thinking about Fifth Uncle

26:49.440 --> 26:50.640
and Hui.

26:51.110 --> 26:53.170
You weren't really afraid of anyone.

26:54.400 --> 26:56.600
Drop by my courtyard when you have time.

27:07.160 --> 27:08.160
This Zhao.

27:08.750 --> 27:09.750
I finally understand

27:09.750 --> 27:10.400
why Xian

27:10.400 --> 27:11.480
likes her so much.

27:13.200 --> 27:14.030
So why don't you

27:14.030 --> 27:15.350
grant Xian's wish?

27:17.350 --> 27:18.160
I can't.

27:19.240 --> 27:21.170
The Imperial Court suppresses
the military nobility.

27:21.170 --> 27:21.790
Look at how they

27:21.790 --> 27:22.750
treat me,

27:23.310 --> 27:24.160
and you'll know how weak

27:24.160 --> 27:26.220
the Marquis's household has become.

27:27.240 --> 27:28.350
Our only plan now

27:29.270 --> 27:31.440
is for Xian to make a good match,

27:31.720 --> 27:33.720
so that we'll have a glimmer of hope.

27:35.270 --> 27:36.830
They're all snobs.

27:37.270 --> 27:38.200
When they came
to ask for my hand in marriage back then,

27:38.200 --> 27:39.750
they were so humble.

27:46.590 --> 27:47.350
My Lady.

27:47.590 --> 27:48.480
Isn't Young Master Yao

27:48.480 --> 27:49.270
Miss Lian's

27:49.270 --> 27:50.310
future husband?

27:50.960 --> 27:53.160
Why did he give you a hairpin in private?

27:54.480 --> 27:55.590
This Yao Wenxiu

27:56.240 --> 27:57.440
is no good.

27:58.720 --> 27:59.240
Well,

27:59.720 --> 28:01.350
should we tell Miss Lian?

28:01.960 --> 28:02.790
Of course not.

28:03.110 --> 28:04.110
How could I say it?

28:04.110 --> 28:05.910
That Yao Wenxiu is hitting on me?

28:06.160 --> 28:07.760
My situation in this mansion

28:07.830 --> 28:09.490
is already difficult enough.

28:11.070 --> 28:12.480
Then this hairpin...

28:15.030 --> 28:15.830
Hide it.

28:16.160 --> 28:17.690
Pretend it never happened.

28:18.920 --> 28:19.920
Yes, My Lady.

28:22.920 --> 28:24.730
Sili Hutong was better.

28:24.920 --> 28:26.720
Although the Eldest Miss is fierce,

28:26.720 --> 28:27.830
she doesn't make trouble.

28:27.830 --> 28:28.970
Unlike here.

28:28.990 --> 28:30.320
Miss Lan always...

28:32.110 --> 28:32.920
Alright.

28:33.590 --> 28:34.980
What's the point of

28:35.240 --> 28:36.570
talking about this now?

28:48.310 --> 28:49.510
You reap

28:49.880 --> 28:51.350
what you sow.

28:52.720 --> 28:53.830
In the future,

28:54.030 --> 28:56.090
you'll only have yourself to rely on.

28:57.550 --> 28:59.210
Only when I stand on my own feet

28:59.880 --> 29:01.160
will I have a chance

29:03.030 --> 29:04.230
to bring Mother back.

29:09.470 --> 29:11.390
[Good Weather for the Crops]

29:17.530 --> 29:19.020
At this Spring Outing,

29:19.140 --> 29:20.230
all the noble ladies,

29:20.230 --> 29:22.540
from 18 to 80,

29:22.830 --> 29:24.290
were competing in beauty.

29:24.920 --> 29:25.590
For a

29:25.590 --> 29:27.160
unique embroidery pattern,

29:27.160 --> 29:28.750
they were willing to spend a lot of money.

29:28.750 --> 29:29.350
What do you

29:29.880 --> 29:31.100
think this means?

29:31.480 --> 29:32.490
Indeed.

29:33.270 --> 29:34.350
This year, the rouge

29:34.350 --> 29:35.750
and silk shops are doing more than

29:35.750 --> 29:37.680
50% better than in previous years.

29:37.830 --> 29:38.400
Right.

29:38.640 --> 29:39.480
So,

29:39.590 --> 29:41.450
that means people have got money.

29:41.680 --> 29:43.480
I plan to turn Linxia Restaurant into

29:43.480 --> 29:45.350
a place exclusively
for women's gatherings.

29:45.350 --> 29:46.920
Women can dine,

29:46.920 --> 29:48.310
have tea,

29:48.510 --> 29:49.840
and watch operas there.

29:50.070 --> 29:51.550
In short, it only serves female guests.

29:51.550 --> 29:53.350
Male guests are not allowed inside.

29:53.350 --> 29:54.270
Didn't you say earlier

29:54.270 --> 29:55.920
that you were going to Shanxi?

29:55.920 --> 29:56.640
Why are you suddenly interested

29:56.640 --> 29:58.070
in the businesses in the capital?

29:58.070 --> 29:59.680
Even if I'm going to Shanxi,

29:59.880 --> 30:00.880
the businesses in the capital

30:00.880 --> 30:02.410
can still operate as usual.

30:04.070 --> 30:04.720
Alright.

30:05.030 --> 30:06.230
I'll head back first.

30:13.000 --> 30:13.590
My Lady,

30:13.750 --> 30:14.830
have you figured it out

30:14.830 --> 30:16.310
and decided not to go to Shanxi?

30:16.310 --> 30:17.510
I haven't made up my mind yet.

30:17.510 --> 30:18.960
It's just that being prepared
for everything

30:18.960 --> 30:20.420
makes me feel more at ease.

30:20.550 --> 30:21.480
Linxia Restaurant

30:21.480 --> 30:23.350
can be considered
half a backup plan for me.

30:23.350 --> 30:24.070
Gu!

30:26.550 --> 30:27.790
Who are you?

30:31.000 --> 30:32.310
I am Wang Zan.

30:33.550 --> 30:36.240
My father is
the Minister of the Court of Judicial...

30:36.240 --> 30:36.830
Review.

30:37.480 --> 30:38.680
Greetings, Mr. Wang.

30:39.680 --> 30:42.070
May I ask what brings you here?

30:42.310 --> 30:43.680
Yesterday during the archery contest,

30:43.680 --> 30:45.000
it was almost my turn,

30:45.070 --> 30:46.160
but that Ye Xian

30:46.160 --> 30:47.180
ruined it for me.

30:47.440 --> 30:49.240
It kept me awake all night.

30:49.830 --> 30:50.720
But today,

30:50.720 --> 30:52.160
I ran into you as soon as I walked out.

30:52.160 --> 30:54.240
It seems my dream has really come true.

30:54.240 --> 30:55.070
I have an manor

30:55.160 --> 30:56.680
with a ready-made training ground.

30:56.680 --> 30:58.350
There's no time like the present.

30:58.350 --> 31:00.200
How about we go there and have a match?

31:00.200 --> 31:01.940
Mr. Wang, you must be joking.

31:02.110 --> 31:03.030
I have some things to do.

31:03.030 --> 31:03.960
I must go now.

31:04.030 --> 31:04.750
Don't.

31:05.110 --> 31:06.000
You are just a girl.

31:06.000 --> 31:07.240
What could you possibly have to do?

31:07.240 --> 31:08.310
Just have a match with me.

31:08.310 --> 31:09.710
I'll feel bad if we don't.

31:09.960 --> 31:12.400
If you really want a match,

31:12.430 --> 31:13.790
wait until the next Spring Outing.

31:13.790 --> 31:14.450
The next...

31:14.790 --> 31:16.270
The next Spring Outing?

31:16.270 --> 31:17.720
Wouldn't that be next year?

31:17.720 --> 31:18.200
No.

31:20.330 --> 31:22.510
You just don't want to have a match
with me, do you?

31:22.510 --> 31:24.110
That's fine. How about this?

31:24.400 --> 31:25.550
I'll treat you to a meal.

31:25.550 --> 31:26.440
At Linxia Restaurant—

31:26.440 --> 31:28.310
the finest bird's nest
and shark fin banquet.

31:28.310 --> 31:29.030
Let's go.

31:29.110 --> 31:30.070
Do me a favor.

31:30.070 --> 31:31.130
Show some respect.

31:31.240 --> 31:32.030
Where did this maid come from?

31:32.030 --> 31:32.870
Get out of the way.

31:32.870 --> 31:34.020
Let's go.

31:33.450 --> 31:39.140
[Baiwei Restaurant]

31:34.510 --> 31:35.570
What are you doing?

31:36.930 --> 31:37.480
What?

31:38.200 --> 31:39.440
Not going to do me a favor?

31:39.440 --> 31:40.550
I, Wang Zan, sincerely

31:40.550 --> 31:41.550
want to make friends with you.

31:41.550 --> 31:42.750
Don't be ungrateful.

31:45.240 --> 31:46.070
I see.

31:46.590 --> 31:47.960
You don't think I'm good enough for you.

31:47.960 --> 31:48.960
That makes sense.

31:49.550 --> 31:51.270
You girls nowadays

31:52.200 --> 31:53.960
only have eyes for pretty boys.

31:54.350 --> 31:54.960
What?

31:55.350 --> 31:56.480
Who caught your eye?

31:57.030 --> 31:59.400
Could it be Yao Wenxiu?

32:00.640 --> 32:01.750
Are you crazy?

32:04.360 --> 32:05.820
Why are you everywhere?

32:08.030 --> 32:09.400
My Lady, just go.

32:09.720 --> 32:10.520
I've got this.

32:11.440 --> 32:12.570
Be gentle! It hurts!

32:13.760 --> 32:14.960
Get away!

32:14.550 --> 32:19.120
[Baiwei Restaurant]

32:19.240 --> 32:20.000
Gu Jinzhao!

32:20.680 --> 32:21.900
Just you wait!

32:22.960 --> 32:26.180
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

32:24.200 --> 32:25.220
Grand Preceptor Xue

32:25.220 --> 32:27.030
came to visit in person yesterday.

32:27.030 --> 32:28.310
He said that Qinglan's personality

32:28.310 --> 32:29.790
is quite different from yours,

32:29.790 --> 32:32.110
and that he fears
you won't get along in the future.

32:32.110 --> 32:33.960
It's not as bad as all that, Madam.

32:33.960 --> 32:35.240
It's normal for two people

32:35.240 --> 32:36.770
not to click on a blind date.

32:36.960 --> 32:37.790
Besides,

32:38.160 --> 32:40.090
I am a few years older than Miss Xue,

32:40.160 --> 32:41.560
and I was married before.

32:41.720 --> 32:43.920
I am indeed not a good match for Miss Xue.

32:49.500 --> 32:50.870
Qinglan was also

32:51.440 --> 32:52.640
betrothed before.

32:53.160 --> 32:54.530
However, before they could be wed,

32:54.530 --> 32:55.990
the groom died of illness.

32:57.000 --> 32:58.110
Lord Xue always feels

32:58.110 --> 32:59.350
he has failed his daughter,

32:59.350 --> 33:01.720
so he yields to her in everything.

33:01.720 --> 33:03.680
Now, even when he tries to discipline her,

33:03.680 --> 33:05.480
he has no control over her at all.

33:06.830 --> 33:08.110
In my opinion,

33:09.270 --> 33:10.550
she's just spoiled.

33:12.480 --> 33:13.160
Later,

33:13.160 --> 33:14.880
I'll look around carefully for you

33:14.880 --> 33:16.140
and pick a better girl.

33:19.400 --> 33:20.400
Thank you, Madam.

33:21.400 --> 33:22.590
At first, I just thought

33:22.590 --> 33:24.250
Qinglan's family background

33:24.480 --> 33:25.810
was a good match for you,

33:25.960 --> 33:27.690
but I overlooked other things.

33:28.550 --> 33:29.980
I haven't asked you yet—

33:30.030 --> 33:32.090
what kind of girl are you looking for?

33:33.640 --> 33:35.040
Don't laugh at me, Madam,

33:35.640 --> 33:37.200
but since Jiang passed away,

33:37.200 --> 33:38.270
all these years,

33:38.480 --> 33:39.750
I've actually

33:39.850 --> 33:41.960
lost interest in marriage.

33:42.310 --> 33:43.910
If I have to remarry,

33:44.070 --> 33:46.260
I'd hope to marry a reasonable

33:46.350 --> 33:48.070
and smart girl.

33:57.960 --> 33:59.360
I shall take my leave now.

34:06.140 --> 34:12.389
[The Heart as a Polished Mirror]

34:09.110 --> 34:10.760
Jiuheng looked like

34:11.070 --> 34:12.590
he had been disheartened.

34:15.150 --> 34:16.800
You actually believe him?

34:17.440 --> 34:18.370
What do you mean?

34:19.800 --> 34:21.710
From the very beginning, he was against

34:21.710 --> 34:23.360
this match-making.

34:24.190 --> 34:26.320
He was just going along with our wishes

34:26.440 --> 34:28.320
and playing along with the arrangement.

34:28.320 --> 34:30.190
But at the Spring Outing,

34:30.440 --> 34:32.060
he deliberately gave in to Qinglan,

34:32.060 --> 34:33.750
intending to anger her

34:33.790 --> 34:35.190
so she would be the one

34:35.190 --> 34:37.110
to call it off.

34:37.880 --> 34:39.070
As for what he said just now

34:39.070 --> 34:40.330
about wanting someone

34:40.480 --> 34:42.280
gentle, virtuous,

34:42.670 --> 34:44.340
and reasonable,

34:44.710 --> 34:45.920
his point was that

34:46.110 --> 34:47.440
choosing Qinglan for him

34:47.440 --> 34:48.550
was a mistake.

34:51.739 --> 34:52.510
He really is

34:52.510 --> 34:53.710
so scheming.

35:01.000 --> 35:02.860
You want to invest in my business?

35:08.920 --> 35:10.150
This is the money

35:10.150 --> 35:11.750
I've saved up over the years.

35:12.360 --> 35:13.280
I did the math.

35:13.590 --> 35:14.920
It totals 8,000 taels.

35:16.030 --> 35:17.360
I'm giving it all to you.

35:18.550 --> 35:19.630
8,000 taels...

35:19.840 --> 35:20.800
is a lot.

35:21.280 --> 35:22.210
It's not enough.

35:22.670 --> 35:24.440
When Second Sister married Yao Wenxiu,

35:24.440 --> 35:26.300
her dowry alone was 20,000 taels.

35:27.070 --> 35:28.590
Even though it somehow

35:28.710 --> 35:30.170
ended up being only 2,000,

35:30.230 --> 35:31.510
the going rate for marriages
in the capital

35:31.510 --> 35:32.550
is just like this.

35:33.030 --> 35:33.880
8,000 taels

35:34.480 --> 35:35.610
is barely anything.

35:37.920 --> 35:40.630
You want to earn your own dowry?

35:42.800 --> 35:43.440
Yes.

35:44.760 --> 35:47.000
My birth mother
is still suffering in the temple.

35:47.000 --> 35:48.550
And Master is the way he is.

35:49.840 --> 35:51.970
I have to figure things out for myself.

35:52.510 --> 35:53.800
Can you help me

35:53.960 --> 35:54.960
and let me invest

35:54.960 --> 35:55.960
in your business?

35:56.550 --> 35:57.840
I'm not picky about the trade,

35:57.840 --> 35:58.800
and I'm not greedy.

35:58.800 --> 36:00.800
As long as it makes money, it's fine.

36:03.510 --> 36:04.150
No.

36:10.110 --> 36:11.440
Is the money not enough?

36:12.030 --> 36:13.160
I can scrape up more.

36:14.360 --> 36:15.760
It's not about the money.

36:16.150 --> 36:17.550
No matter how much you give me,

36:17.550 --> 36:18.710
I won't agree.

36:19.630 --> 36:20.400
Go back.

36:22.480 --> 36:23.320
Why?

36:27.440 --> 36:28.240
Zhao,

36:28.960 --> 36:30.360
I know you don't like me.

36:30.960 --> 36:32.000
But...

36:32.190 --> 36:33.710
we are sisters after all.

36:34.800 --> 36:36.000
Please help me

36:36.110 --> 36:37.190
and let me invest

36:37.190 --> 36:38.190
in your business.

36:39.320 --> 36:40.850
What if you lose your money?

36:42.630 --> 36:43.590
Doing business

36:44.000 --> 36:45.590
means you might lose money.

36:46.280 --> 36:47.400
You just said

36:47.400 --> 36:48.400
you're not greedy

36:48.630 --> 36:50.290
and just want to make a profit.

36:50.880 --> 36:52.150
For that reason alone,

36:52.630 --> 36:53.510
I won't let you

36:53.510 --> 36:54.480
invest.

36:58.400 --> 36:59.320
Sit down first.

37:05.630 --> 37:07.360
I see where you're coming from.

37:08.280 --> 37:09.740
You have no steady income,

37:10.070 --> 37:11.810
and the savings you have

37:11.840 --> 37:12.840
are quite modest.

37:13.230 --> 37:15.440
So you dare not take risks.

37:17.190 --> 37:18.840
But I don't work with people

37:19.480 --> 37:21.070
who dare not take risks.

37:27.840 --> 37:28.840
Qing is here.

37:32.000 --> 37:34.550
Grandmother, Third Uncle, Little Aunt.

37:35.190 --> 37:36.840
You're back. Take a seat.

37:41.110 --> 37:42.440
Is it your day off today?

37:42.800 --> 37:43.280
Yes.

37:43.710 --> 37:45.880
I thought I'd come back to get some books.

37:45.880 --> 37:47.540
You haven't eaten yet, right?

37:47.840 --> 37:48.510
Exactly.

37:49.030 --> 37:49.920
On my way here,

37:50.000 --> 37:52.530
I thought about
grabbing a bite at your place.

37:53.030 --> 37:53.550
Hurry.

37:53.800 --> 37:54.920
Take the newly delivered

37:54.920 --> 37:56.360
meat-stuffed biscuits

37:56.360 --> 37:57.620
and put them on a plate.

37:57.760 --> 37:59.320
Qing loves them.

37:59.440 --> 38:00.070
Yes.

38:00.230 --> 38:01.400
Thank you, Grandmother.

38:01.400 --> 38:02.330
You are the best.

38:02.590 --> 38:04.030
Come on, Third-Ranked Scholar,

38:04.030 --> 38:05.510
you've only been working for a few days,

38:05.510 --> 38:07.280
and you've already learned
how to sweet-talk.

38:07.280 --> 38:09.080
You must be joking, Little Aunt.

38:10.030 --> 38:11.760
You came back at the right time.

38:12.480 --> 38:13.190
I was just about to

38:13.190 --> 38:15.050
discuss it with your Third Uncle.

38:15.280 --> 38:17.800
Now that you have a proper job,

38:18.230 --> 38:20.510
we should start preparing

38:20.840 --> 38:22.500
for your wedding with Wanxue.

38:22.670 --> 38:25.070
How about setting it for
the end of the year?

38:25.670 --> 38:26.870
The end of the year...

38:27.140 --> 38:28.400
might be a bit tight.

38:31.150 --> 38:32.150
Here is the thing.

38:32.320 --> 38:33.550
The Imperial Court is sending envoys

38:33.550 --> 38:35.400
to negotiate peace with the Beiman.

38:35.400 --> 38:37.400
The Hanlin Academy
also needs to send someone.

38:37.400 --> 38:38.480
Today, I volunteered for the mission

38:38.480 --> 38:39.610
with Scholar Chang.

38:39.800 --> 38:41.670
He said as long as you agree,

38:42.000 --> 38:42.930
he won't stop me.

38:44.230 --> 38:45.560
You are going to Beiman?

38:46.230 --> 38:48.230
Beiman is so dangerous.

38:48.750 --> 38:50.410
Why are you going there?

38:51.280 --> 38:52.400
Grandmother, please don't worry.

38:52.400 --> 38:54.510
The Beiman envoys are coming this time.

38:54.510 --> 38:55.480
Our envoys

38:55.480 --> 38:56.880
only need to go to Datong.

39:01.760 --> 39:03.220
Why did you suddenly think

39:03.480 --> 39:05.480
of getting involved in this matter?

39:05.510 --> 39:06.590
Are you unhappy

39:06.590 --> 39:07.850
in the Hanlin Academy?

39:07.880 --> 39:09.320
I won't hide it from you, Third Uncle.

39:09.320 --> 39:10.110
Working in the Hanlin Academy

39:10.110 --> 39:11.280
isn't unpleasant,

39:11.440 --> 39:12.440
but too pleasant.

39:13.030 --> 39:14.150
Every day, I just compile books.

39:14.150 --> 39:15.150
And not too many.

39:15.550 --> 39:16.280
Compiling too much

39:16.280 --> 39:17.880
will only make colleagues uncomfortable.

39:17.880 --> 39:18.840
Submitting five entries a day

39:18.840 --> 39:20.370
to the superiors is enough.

39:20.480 --> 39:22.070
The rest of the time is spent reading

39:22.070 --> 39:23.150
and practicing calligraphy.

39:23.150 --> 39:24.480
Because of you, Third Uncle,

39:24.480 --> 39:25.440
others treat me

39:25.440 --> 39:26.550
very politely.

39:27.510 --> 39:28.710
I'm really afraid that after a few years

39:28.710 --> 39:29.770
of muddling along,

39:29.800 --> 39:31.260
my drive will be worn away.

39:32.840 --> 39:34.240
You're getting anxious?

39:35.030 --> 39:35.630
Yes.

39:36.670 --> 39:37.280
Back then,

39:37.300 --> 39:38.760
you also transferred
from the Hanlin Academy

39:38.760 --> 39:40.490
to the Water Transport Office.

39:40.590 --> 39:42.710
I intend to follow your example.

39:43.070 --> 39:43.710
I hope to be able

39:43.710 --> 39:45.230
to do some practical work.

39:47.550 --> 39:49.610
The peace talks with Beiman this time

39:49.800 --> 39:52.060
are highly valued by the Imperial Court.

39:52.840 --> 39:54.440
If the talks are successful,

39:54.710 --> 39:56.440
it will be a great achievement.

39:56.960 --> 39:58.220
As a top-tier scholar,

39:58.800 --> 40:00.000
the Court will definitely entrust you

40:00.000 --> 40:01.960
with heavy responsibilities
upon your return.

40:01.960 --> 40:03.030
This is indeed faster than

40:03.030 --> 40:04.320
staying in the Hanlin Academy,

40:04.320 --> 40:05.480
enduring step by step,

40:05.480 --> 40:07.080
and waiting for a promotion.

40:08.630 --> 40:10.230
Since you've made up your mind,

40:10.230 --> 40:11.030
then go ahead.

40:16.360 --> 40:18.820
Thank you for your permission,
Third Uncle.

40:18.920 --> 40:19.400
Sit.

40:23.630 --> 40:24.960
A trip to Datong

40:25.280 --> 40:27.190
will take several months round trip.

40:27.190 --> 40:28.320
I'm afraid your marriage with Wanxue

40:28.320 --> 40:29.580
will be delayed again.

40:31.150 --> 40:32.630
Let it be delayed.

40:33.360 --> 40:35.090
Your future is more important.

40:39.190 --> 40:42.550
It really is "Regretting urging my husband
to seek official rank."

40:42.550 --> 40:43.320
Shut up.

40:46.480 --> 40:47.340
Drink the soup.

40:49.880 --> 40:50.810
It smells great.

41:10.480 --> 41:12.360
Inside is a Duan inkstone

41:12.380 --> 41:13.780
and a box of Xuanyuan ink.

41:13.920 --> 41:15.150
The ink is ordinary,

41:15.480 --> 41:16.740
but this Duan inkstone

41:17.000 --> 41:19.260
is an antique from the previous dynasty.

41:21.080 --> 41:23.060
I found it rustic and lovely,

41:23.320 --> 41:24.980
so I am gifting it to you today.

41:38.960 --> 41:41.000
Hearing that you don't have
to marry by the end of the year,

41:41.000 --> 41:42.330
you look much brighter.

41:43.000 --> 41:44.000
You talk too much.

41:44.880 --> 41:45.880
Actually, I know.

41:46.150 --> 41:47.360
If it weren't Miss Yu,

41:47.400 --> 41:48.480
but Miss Gu,

41:48.670 --> 41:51.110
you definitely wouldn't want
to go to Shanxi.

41:51.110 --> 41:51.760
Yunting.

41:52.190 --> 41:53.120
If I ever hear you

41:53.590 --> 41:55.360
say such things again,

41:56.590 --> 41:58.520
you won't need to serve me anymore.

41:59.880 --> 42:00.760
I see.

42:01.110 --> 42:02.240
I won't say it again.

42:11.930 --> 42:14.370
[The Penal Court]

42:18.550 --> 42:19.350
Young Master.

42:19.360 --> 42:20.700
This is a servant from the Xue family

42:20.700 --> 42:21.760
delivering an invitation to you.

42:21.760 --> 42:24.490
He has been waiting from the afternoon
until now.

42:24.630 --> 42:25.630
Which Xue family?

42:26.620 --> 42:28.150
[To Young Master Ye]

42:32.320 --> 42:33.360
Xue Qinglan?

42:33.590 --> 42:34.230
Our lady

42:34.230 --> 42:36.230
would like to ask Your Highness
when you are free.

42:36.230 --> 42:38.030
She wants to invite you
to Linxia Restaurant for a drink.

42:38.030 --> 42:39.230
Invite me for a drink?

42:43.550 --> 42:44.680
Young Master Ye said

42:44.840 --> 42:46.190
he's been busy with errands lately

42:46.190 --> 42:47.590
and can't spare any time.

42:51.480 --> 42:53.140
I want to hear his exact words.

42:54.480 --> 42:55.810
His exact words were...

42:56.320 --> 42:57.850
"She has too much free time.

42:57.920 --> 42:59.120
Tell her to get lost."

43:07.070 --> 43:08.110
Interesting.

43:08.960 --> 43:09.840
I haven't met

43:09.840 --> 43:12.170
such an interesting person in a long time.

43:14.530 --> 43:16.880
[The Reform of Land and Taxation]

43:18.960 --> 43:21.710
She said herself
that she doesn't have time to see me?

43:21.710 --> 43:23.510
Miss Qingpu passed the message.

43:23.550 --> 43:24.360
I suppose Miss Gu

43:24.360 --> 43:25.510
is busy with her business right now,

43:25.510 --> 43:26.320
so...

43:28.440 --> 43:30.070
She is mad at me

43:30.110 --> 43:31.510
about the Spring Outing.

43:34.480 --> 43:35.510
By the way, Third Master.

43:35.510 --> 43:36.890
I heard a rumor

43:37.110 --> 43:38.840
that the family of the Minister
of the Court of Judicial Review,

43:38.840 --> 43:40.320
the Wangs, have taken a fancy to Miss Gu.

43:40.320 --> 43:41.840
Wang Shenzhi's son,

43:41.840 --> 43:42.370
Wang Zan?

43:42.880 --> 43:43.320
Yes.

43:43.920 --> 43:44.670
That Mr. Wang

43:44.670 --> 43:46.330
is telling everyone out there

43:46.590 --> 43:48.070
that Miss Gu is unreasonable.

43:47.950 --> 43:52.640
[Immersed in the Classics and History]

43:48.440 --> 43:49.630
If his grandmother wasn't

43:49.630 --> 43:51.480
old friends with
the Gu family's Old Madam,

43:51.480 --> 43:53.230
he wouldn't even consider Miss Gu.

43:53.230 --> 43:54.510
To me,

43:54.630 --> 43:57.030
it sounds like
they are planning to propose.

43:57.030 --> 43:58.490
Wang Zan?

43:58.670 --> 43:59.960
Does he even deserve her?

43:59.960 --> 44:00.630
Exactly.

44:01.760 --> 44:02.560
Third Master,

44:03.000 --> 44:04.920
we can't just let them propose, can we?

44:04.920 --> 44:05.550
Of course.

44:20.390 --> 44:24.000
[A Splendid Match]
